Not covered by this licence
  builder/config/companies-found.yml — board slugs unioned with three
    open-source lists that keep their own terms: OpenRoles (CC BY-SA 4.0),
    job-board-aggregator (CC BY-NC 4.0), JobSeek (CC BY-NC 4.0). The file's
    header credits them.
  builder/config/careers-found.yml — hosts read from Web Data Commons'
    extraction of Common Crawl, under those projects' terms.
  catalogues/codes/isco.json and catalogues/families.json — occupation titles
    from ESCO, © European Union, reused with attribution.
  The job adverts this software collects — they belong to the sources that
    published them; app/legal/sources.html names each source and its terms.
  The packages named in package.json — each under its own licence.

